%% Figure: Platform view. Seed, producers, consumers and core interactions.
flowchart TB
    ORG(["<b>Producers: Organisers</b><br/>create events, inventory,<br/>waiting rooms, teams"])
    HLP(["<b>Producers: Helpers</b><br/>produce check-in data"])
    CUS(["<b>Consumers: Customers</b><br/>buy and attend"])

    subgraph Platform["OneStage platform"]
        SEED[["<b>Seed: a ticketable event</b><br/>its inventory and its QR tickets"]]
        CORE["<b>Core interaction</b><br/>discover → queue (Tier 2) → reserve →<br/>pay → receive ticket → check in"]
        SEED --> CORE
    end

    ORG -->|publishes| SEED
    ORG -. invites .-> HLP
    HLP -->|"validates tickets<br/>at the door"| CORE
    CUS -->|takes part in| CORE
    CUS -. "becomes an organiser of their own event<br/>(roles are per event, not per account)" .-> ORG
